Subject: [PATCH v2 14/16] dotfiles/notmuch: Drop the jj maildir profile
To: lab@lists.p7x.dev
Cc: Pat Maddox <pat@patmaddox.com>
Change-Id: sprtsxxlomtqqvknmqzrtnmplonkmxln
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 02:33:39 +0000

The default profile indexed the jj maildir, which no client reads
once beastie and lab-claude use the lab-mail profile. Keeping its
hooks and sample would leave two sets of tagging rules to maintain,
one of them for mail that no longer arrives.
